error[DS0111]: `!` is not an operator
  --> query:1:22
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | where !(amount > 10 or amount < 1)
  |                      ^
  |
  = help: negate it with `not(...)`: `not(amount > 10 or amount < 1)`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
